keywords:
  - QGIS
  - remote sensing
  - Sentinel-2
  - open data
  - Model Context Protocol
  - geospatial toolbox
abstract: >-
  A QGIS plugin that puts live public geospatial data behind buttons: a Data
  Explorer dashboard with an area of interest picker, satellite imagery and
  spectral indices, weather and climate, elevation and 3D, land cover, soil,
  water, species, sensor networks, population and a live monitor, plus a
  permission gated Model Context Protocol bridge so AI assistants can drive
  QGIS through the same engine.
